t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afswj6tI6dX7J0cBvvJy6BjHdl-8KbtrOr7ZIsC9ufg3gw&oe=699F03B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GmR5WvRZhiYQ7kNvwGgHfzH&_nc_oc=AdngbJjJ-_Stqbw0QKFvwJaAyFjNZ8JZEDsFNZTWngvHpfiZusJX0yeef9TxPDNox7c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftI2glP19TE3pBE2VX9QorRutrRSPtqmMxlsBpZz0FChA&oe=699F054A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ucwpv9gFtOMQ7kNvwG5vH5e&_nc_oc=Admv0j4qvgugKBJIeNUG2aAUIZuvY3l539nrlUk4zWlddvBQnjbxD8d4KlfwW81ZXIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftl0LO0BU5wEbGB_vxXq3QfSPhnP5eqTyWfoKyw5Ug29w&oe=699EF26F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LozZy6B59JcQ7kNvwFHWp69&_nc_oc=Admg9-tpzvfOcWCGfG_-u0gCQ11YgILsuiXg1Jpp3ZO8tpHb-aLHdC214ZHoLBMLZHw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuY672aw4CZiSMdqpqpEMREWqFVBKtiz_cRNUiiMX4hcQ&oe=699EDBC3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pRgnXgfZti0Q7kNvwGXlqAu&_nc_oc=Adnutbt94vYUeoxqd2NJgLXUbk7szVCx1fwD9fG3ITw_XSXNBilPOY-ZLcbzP0R8OF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftK1FRVXPX78D0B3CHsr2GkBgG_FmXye9cgx8kUXkRpBw&oe=699ED418"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nw0D_Fub4tsQ7kNvwFlqkBg&_nc_oc=Admqlg3V4wJDFFoMxyBmqFkGATOwZdWkEDWtn40sONj-YE-4sKQ4rtOQ26VYy79n7bM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuv-CkQeBSAHrSov1zRlIuRGV92d9mVQLTFhBl4MUmBEg&oe=699EE73C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bzxgUsQAZSIQ7kNvwHeebmo&_nc_oc=AdmRfQ6wYHvbMKE7rZUWCK7C-p-jIIp-JHF8Gl24qxAlNdd9O5qyyCAatMJw3XkrYbw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=sco